e people  to get in touch with them as quickly as  they possibly can fraser thank you  absolutely gruesome details though as  fraser was just saying there um new  details have emerged of how a man  entered the house that olivia pratt cole  bell was in yesterday merseyside police  of course have been speaking to us a  short time ago we heard earlier from  chief constable serena kennedy who  described the situation as shocking and  appalling attack which will reverberate  around our community she confirmed of  course yesterday that the police were  called to olivia's home at around 10  o'clock yesterday night let's have a  listen to what she said earlier  at 10 pm last night our officers were  called to olivia's home on kingsmooth  avenue  and when we arrived we found three  people had been injured  including olivia  and her mum  it is believed that one of the injured  parties a 35 year old man was being  chased by a man armed with a gun he was  firing at him  the man being chased forced his way into  olivia's house  and the offender ran in after him  firing a number of shots  with complete disregard for olivia and  her family who had no connection with  the gunman or the man who fought his way  in  sadly olivia was fatally wounded when  the gunman fired at the man who was  trying to get into the house  and her mum also suffered a gunshot to  her wrist  the first 35 year old man had been  chased suffered a number of gunshots to  his upper body  olivia lay dying  he was picked up by his friends who took  him to hospital  on arrival our offices could see just  how poorly olivia was  and they rushed her to alderhay  children's hospital where despite the  best efforts of medical staff  she sadly died  and her mum was taken to hospital by  colleagues from the northwest ambulance  service  this is a shocking and appalling attack  which will reverberate around our  communities  and i want to take this opportunity  again to appeal to anybody who knows who  is responsible for 